        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rosmontis! Wait!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$dignified_intro",
        "key": "$dignified_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_042",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh... Blaze.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're badly wounded. Why are you here? You should go back. Go on.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#9",
        "name2": "avg_npc_042",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you going to sortie this time?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#9",
        "name2": "avg_npc_042",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_042",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll get someone to replace you. How about Misery? He's better at assault ops than you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "He'll wave his hand and it'll be all done. Let's have him go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_042",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't want me to go?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_042",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah. You shouldn't.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_042",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're giving me a weird feeling, Blaze.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_042",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "This isn't like the missions you went on before!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_042",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Because I might die?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#6",
        "name2": "avg_npc_042",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Watch it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can't just... like... you can't just come out and say it like that!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're too young for such a dangerous mission. It's not right!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#6",
        "name2": "avg_npc_042",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But Amiya's going too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_042",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That's because she...! She's...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_042",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "She's just like me. She's Infected. She's an operator.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "text": "And I checked the logs. Ace and Scout are both in Chernobog. They didn't come back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "text": "That means they're gone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "text": "I want to see. I want to know what happened. I want to see who's running Reunion. I want to know who did what.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "text": "I want to know what happened to Ace and Scout.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#10",
        "name2": "avg_npc_042",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Rosmontis? You don't have to record... that kind of stuff.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#10",
        "name2": "avg_npc_042",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Blaze?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_042",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Shit. What the hell am I saying...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, sorry, I shouldn't have said that. Damn my big mouth!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, their deaths... They...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_042",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Blaze.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_042",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm the one who's wrong. We have happy memories, and painful ones too. You have to remember them both.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_042",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're weird, Blaze. Your words are all scattered and broken.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_042",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...I don't want to see you hurting so much. Why do you have to look back at them? You... you can let go of those memories.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can put them there, leave them there, and don't look back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_042",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "If I don't look... then what's the point in recording them?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "text": "If I don't look... then they're forgotten.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "text": "I won't forget. I definitely won't forget a single death.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_042",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ha. Right. You're like me. You're a Rhodes Island elite operator.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't go in your place. Really, I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nng... ugh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_042",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're bleeding again?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_042",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_042",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll take you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_042",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oof.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rosmontis... You and Amiya look after yourselves.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_042",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Right. I will.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
