        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "Take us up! We've got some weird-colored balls clipping us!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't be scared, Instructor. Reunion casters aren't good enough to shoot us down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pilot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We're just a distraction, no need to put on an air show for Reunion!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Put on a good enough show and Reunion might just surrender, huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pilot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Isn't that what they call a show of force?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pilot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Aerial acrobatics isn't a show of force!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.4,
        "xstrength": 0,
        "ystrength": 8,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 30,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hold on tight, Instructor!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pilot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.4,
        "xstrength": 0,
        "ystrength": 8,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 30,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014I need a barf bag!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
