        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The sand will cover our tracks. Remember your protective gear, and don't let sand into our sensitive equipment!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "But... I can see the sun. Why is the sunlight breaking through the sandstorm?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "The underside of the core city is so clear, it's like... Arts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "This wasn't... part of the plan. Is that natural light?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_148_nearl_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Don't worry about it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nearl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Roger that! Grappling hooks, prepare to fire! Operators, make sure the cables are securely fixed to the underside of the city!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Once all our operators are aboard, the vehicles will depart at once! I don't usually say things like this, but I'm pretty sure that light just now is a good omen for us!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Definitely!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nearl"
    },
    {
        "text": "(I made it a little too intense and had to aim it at the ground, but let's not tell her that part...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nearl"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hold on, the core city is speeding up?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nearl"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our machines are wind-driven, but they can only keep the sandstorm up within a one kilometer range! If they break that range, they'll spot us for sure!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nearl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hurry up, everyone!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
