    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're out of time! We have to slow down!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pilot"
    },
    {
        "text": "If we drive out of the sandstorm,, Chernobog's optical detection system will pick us right up and blow the whole op!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pilot"
    },
    {
        "text": "How many people do you have left? Hurry up and...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pilot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "There aren't any left.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pilot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "I'll do it myself!;(Silently put on a dust mask);Pass me the carabiner. I'm going myself.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's too dangerous, Doctor!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pilot"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've never had operator training! We can't send you up there alone!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pilot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Didn't Dr. Kal'tsit assign you any battlefield support?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pilot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Nope. What of it?;......;Maybe she thought I could use the exercise myself.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I did.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "?!",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kal'tsit grabbed by the waist with one arm and pulled you onto the zipline with the other."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
